# Smart Irrigation System

## Overview

The Smart Irrigation System is an IoT-based irrigation project designed to monitor soil moisture and automatically control a water pump according to predefined moisture conditions.

The system uses a NodeMCU ESP8266, soil moisture sensor and relay module. Wi-Fi connectivity enables the system to be extended for cloud-based monitoring using Firebase.

## Objectives

* Monitor soil moisture automatically
* Reduce unnecessary irrigation
* Automate water-pump operation
* Use IoT connectivity for remote monitoring
* Demonstrate sensor interfacing and embedded programming

