| ----------------------- | ----------- |
| Soil Moisture Sensor AO | A0          |
| Relay Signal            | D1          |

## Firebase Data Structure

The project is structured for cloud-based monitoring of parameters such as:

* Raw sensor value
* Moisture percentage
* Pump status
* System status

Example:

```json
{
  "sensorValue": 620,
  "moisturePercentage": 42,
  "pumpStatus": "OFF",
  "systemStatus": "Moisture sufficient"
}
```

