## Testing

The system control logic was tested by monitoring soil moisture conditions and verifying the corresponding pump-control states.

Testing focuses on:

* Sensor reading
* Moisture percentage calculation
* Dry-soil detection
* Pump activation
* Moisture recovery
* Pump deactivation
* Wi-Fi connectivity

Actual sensor calibration values may vary depending on the sensor and soil conditions.

## Security

Credentials such as Wi-Fi passwords and Firebase authentication information should not be committed to the public repository.

Placeholder values are used in the source code.

